<title>SRI LANKA: Richard Pieris says 12-mth net up 72 pct.</title>
<headline>Richard Pieris says 12-mth net up 72 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	 (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				 1997		 1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	     2,098.72   vs    1,886.82</p>
<p>    Net profit	     161.47   vs	 93.97</p>
<p>    Tax provision	   24.46   vs	 20.20</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Richard Pieris &amp; Co Ltd &amp; Co consolidates accounts of four companies, of which one is listed. The group's businesses include marketing of household, industrial and agricultural products. It also manages plantations.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
